<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῠπεπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ripened on the tree, quite
				ripe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chionid.
					7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				312
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ δρυπεπεῖς</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχάδες</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				564
			</span></i>, Callias Com.<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>: by a com. metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζαι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					165
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἑταῖραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					141
				</span></i>
			: heterocl. acc. sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἁλίπαστον
				δρύπεπα,</span> as Subst., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.191
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Longus</span>):—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρυπετής</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῠο-πέτης</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίπτω</span>), <i>ready to fall, over-ripe,</i>
			is a constant v. l., cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2p.746D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
